      "rendered": "4th Annual E-Recycling PDX Event held Aug. 26, 2023"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n  <div class=\"banner has-hover\" id=\"banner-1233093873\">\n          <div class=\"banner-inner fill\">\n        <div class=\"banner-bg fill\" >\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1020\" height=\"1020\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/E-RECYCLING_ICON-WIFI_2022_transparent-white-fill-1024x1024.png\" class=\"bg attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" />                        <div class=\"overlay\"></div>            \n                    </div>\n\t\t\n        <div class=\"banner-layers container\">\n            <div class=\"fill banner-link\"></div>            \n   <div id=\"text-box-1411913981\" class=\"text-box banner-layer x95 md-x95 lg-x95 y50 md-y50 lg-y50 res-text\">\n                                <div class=\"text-box-content text box-shadow-3\">\n              \n              <div class=\"text-inner text-center\">\n                  \n<h3 class=\"uppercase\"><span style=\"font-size: 100%;\"><strong>4th Annual E-Recycling PDX Event</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">This year the event took place on August 26, 2023 10am &#8211; 4p at Rose Haven  <a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\">rosehaven.org!</a>!!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Please join us again in 2024 and bring primarily cellphones and laptops to safely donate to be <span style=\"color: #993300;\"><strong>safely cleared</strong></span>, recycled, and given to 4 local non-profits that help men, women, and children get back on their feet.</p>\n<a href=\"https://getlagosnow.com/accepted-event-donations/\" class=\"button primary is-outline\" >\n\t\t<span>Accepted Donations</span>\n\t</a>\n\n              </div>\n           </div>\n                            \n<style>\n#text-box-1411913981 .text-box-content {\n  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);\n  font-size: 100%;\n}\n#text-box-1411913981 .text-inner {\n  padding: 30px 30px 30px 30px;\n}\n#text-box-1411913981 {\n  width: 60%;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #text-box-1411913981 {\n    width: 40%;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n    </div>\n \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n            \n<style>\n#banner-1233093873 {\n  padding-top: 800px;\n}\n#banner-1233093873 .overlay {\n  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n}\n</style>\n  </div>\n\n\n<h2> </h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Event Results</strong> </span>&#8211; This year we&#8217;re happy to report that we received over 35 laptops and 27  I-phones.  We look forward to looking into these electronics more carefully and finding out which ones can be revived and given back out to our receiving non-profits in 2023/2024!!</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 150%; color: #0000ff; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong>2023 Donations </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">Two laptops to <strong><a href=\"https://blanchethouse.org/\">Blanchet House &amp; Farm</a></strong> &#8211; At the farm location. </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3830 alignnone\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Best-Ross-laptop-pick.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"398\" height=\"798\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Best-Ross-laptop-pick.jpeg 319w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Best-Ross-laptop-pick-150x300.jpeg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 398px) 100vw, 398px\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">Two cellphones and two laptop donation to<a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\"><strong> Rose Haven</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3831\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Best-Liz-donation-pic.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Best-Liz-donation-pic.jpg 640w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Best-Liz-donation-pic-300x225.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">Two desktops and one laptop to <strong><a href=\"https://raphaelhouse.com/\">Raphael House.</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3832 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Raphael-House-donation-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"579\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Raphael-House-donation-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Raphael-House-donation-225x300.jpg 225w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Raphael-House-donation-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Raphael-House-donation.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 434px) 100vw, 434px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"is-divider divider clearfix\" ></div>\n\t<div class=\"box has-hover   has-hover box-text-bottom\" >\n\n\t\t<div class=\"box-image\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"\" >\n\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1841\" height=\"1195\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/embassy-social-media-post.png\" class=\"attachment- size-\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/embassy-social-media-post.png 1841w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/embassy-social-media-post-300x195.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/embassy-social-media-post-1024x665.png 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/embassy-social-media-post-768x499.png 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/embassy-social-media-post-1536x997.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1841px) 100vw, 1841px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"box-text text-center\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"box-text-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<h4>Be the <a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x6umtig x1b1mbwd xaqea5y xav7gou x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xt0b8zv x1fey0fg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"http://e-recyclingpdx.com/?fbclid=IwAR2AsM0PfqzPh78Pc3p-ExX2-3VFdDY7f898Wu9kQzCVSkRoF1gIpG_vilA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">E-Recyclingpdx.com</a> donor that WINS this 2-Night Suite stay at Embassy Suites in downtown PDX! Join us at Rose Haven &#8211; <a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x6umtig x1b1mbwd xaqea5y xav7gou x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xt0b8zv x1fey0fg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://rosehaven.org/?fbclid=IwAR2pMvPfUmA7DWtF1cxi_NTvMnbNyycYqzcap7OZ_-1bOhyJZFr1pROAY3s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://rosehaven.org</a> &#8211; on August 26th between 10am &#8211; 4p and come bring your old laptops and cellphones to be safely refurbished and donated!!</h4>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n<div class=\"container section-title-container\" ><h3 class=\"section-title section-title-normal\"><b aria-hidden=\"true\"></b><span class=\"section-title-main\" style=\"font-size:146%;color:rgb(154, 95, 199);\">Come listen to Rainezra perform between 12p - 2:30p!!!</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\"></b></h3></div>\n<div class=\"video video-fit mb\" style=\"padding-top:56.25%;\"><p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Responsibilities\" width=\"1020\" height=\"574\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=OLAK5uy_kGwSQPQ0zf4fOeC6pwW0heUpAR8mGT2oQ\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"is-divider divider clearfix\" style=\"height:30px;\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"box has-hover   has-hover box-text-bottom\" >\n\n\t\t<div class=\"box-image\" style=\"width:48%;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"box-text text-center\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"box-text-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<h4>Join us on August 26th at 11am at <a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\">Rose Haven</a> and come hear <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/linda-nilsen-410b7417/\">Linda Nilsen</a>, from <a href=\"https://www.healthplansinoregon.com/\">Health Plans of Oregon</a> tell us more about the ways we can take care of ourselves and those we love.</h4>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"box has-hover   has-hover box-text-bottom\" >\n\n\t\t<div class=\"box-image\" style=\"width:50%;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"\" >\n\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2164\" height=\"2164\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Debra-Pride.jpg\" class=\"attachment- size-\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Debra-Pride.jpg 2164w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Debra-Pride-300x300.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Debra-Pride-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Debra-Pride-150x150.jpg 150w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Debra-Pride-768x768.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Debra-Pride-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Debra-Pride-2048x2048.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2164px) 100vw, 2164px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"box-text text-center\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"box-text-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<h4><strong> Join us on August 26th at 11:30am at <a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\">Rose Haven</a>,</strong></h4>\n<div>\n<h4><strong>and come hear <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/debraporta/\">Debra Porta</a> from <a href=\"https://www.pridenw.org/pridenwblog/new-dates-announced-for-2023-portland-pride-waterfront-festival-and-parade\">Pride Northwest</a> tell us more </strong></h4>\n<h4><strong>about the many ways Pride Northwest is doing good for our community. </strong></h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"is-divider divider clearfix\" ></div>\n<div class=\"container section-title-container\" ><h3 class=\"section-title section-title-bold-center\"><b aria-hidden=\"true\"></b><span class=\"section-title-main\" >Event Pics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\"></b></h3></div>\n\n  \n    <div class=\"row large-columns-4 medium-columns-3 small-columns-2\" >\n  <div class=\"gallery-col col\" >\n          <div class=\"col-inner\">\n            <a class=\"image-lightbox lightbox-gallery\" href=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/unicorn-Gary-768x1024.jpg\" title=\"\">            <div class=\"box has-hover gallery-box box-overlay dark\">\n              <div class=\"box-image\" >\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/unicorn-Gary-225x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" ids=\"3779,3780,3781,3782,3783,3784,3785,3786\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/unicorn-Gary-225x300.jpg 225w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/unicorn-Gary-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/unicorn-Gary-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/unicorn-Gary.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" />                                  <div class=\"overlay fill\"\n                      style=\"background-color: rgba(0,0,0,.15)\">\n                  </div>\n                                                              </div>\n    